# Rust build output (workspace builds to /target; also catch any nested crate build)
/target
target/
**/*.rs.bk

# mdBook render output
/docs/book

# Private design docs — kept local, out of the repo (spec sources only)
/docs/src/*-SPEC.md

# AI assistant / local agent files (CLAUDE.md is tracked — repo build guide)
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.aider*
.cursor/

# The repo is itself a node in the author's live tree, so `pan` mints this node's meta
# dir (§6.3) here on first annotation. That is tree metadata, not repo content — and the
# code is whatever the node wears, so the pattern follows a recode rather than pinning one.
/*__/

# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED — this is a binary-producing workspace (§15). Do not ignore it.

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editors
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
